# Super-linter GO_MODULES runs golangci-lint on every directory that
# contains a changed Go file. These paths only contain //go:build ignore
# programs, so that invocation fails with "build constraints exclude all
# Go files" and lints nothing. checks.sh turns the paths below into
# FILTER_REGEX_EXCLUDE. The files stay in the repository; lint skips them.
examples/
verify_interface.go
